 of those hours are considered your own free time. You can fill in those hours however you want. Explore and find secrets. Go around shopping. Decorate your home. Go gambling. Or simply relax at home with your cat. Fill in those hours however you'd like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just remember to stay out of the kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132610/extras/1fc7c65f2e9c57180704604551fdb701.avif?t=1786550299\" width=1024 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132610/extras/e40c0fc689ed1fac17d4331bb0ce224e.poster.avif?t=1786550299\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132610/extras/e40c0fc689ed1fac17d4331bb0ce224e.webm?t=1786550299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132610/extras/e40c0fc689ed1fac17d4331bb0ce224e.mp4?t=1786550299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unfortunately, we cannot be out delivering soup all day. So make sure to get all the rest and proteins you may need outside of working hours. Only a healthy deliverer will be able to satisfy our customers. The local shops are open during the day, so feel free to get your fill out of them when you can. That way you can perform at peak performance during your deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132610/extras/03a0e37b51d495a37e0d10b55e455e06.avif?t=1786550299\" width=1024 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla